  "description": "Dear Risk Management Team,\n\nPlease find below the latest buy\u2011sell information for the client (type\u202f2) under limit kind\u202f0. The security is not a margin security (is_margin_sec\u202f=\u202f0) but it is classified as an asset security (is_asset_sec\u202f=\u202f1). Both long and short positions are permitted (is_long_allowed\u202f=\u202f1, is_short_allowed\u202f=\u202f1). The step sizes are d_long\u202f=\u202f0.01 with a minimum d_min_long\u202f=\u202f0.001, and d_short\u202f=\u202f0.01 with a minimum d_min_short\u202f=\u202f0.001.\n\nFinancially, the account balance stands at\u202f12500.50 and the current position valuation is\u202f15000.00. The market\u2011valued position (value) is\u202f15200.35, while the open\u2011value reference is\u202f14800.00. Upper limits are lim_long\u202f=\u202f20000 (long_coef\u202f=\u202f0.8) and lim_short\u202f=\u202f15000 (short_coef\u202f=\u202f0.6). Value and open\u2011value coefficients are value_coef\u202f=\u202f1.02 and open_value_coef\u202f=\u202f0.99, respectively, yielding a share of\u202f0.75. The weighted\u2011average prices are short_wa_price\u202f=\u202f14950.12 and long_wa_price\u202f=\u202f15120.45. The position shows a profit/loss of\u202f1200.35 and a spread (HC) of\u202f0.5. The client has the right to buy (can_buy\u202f=\u202f1) and sell (can_sell\u202f=\u202f1) in general, and specifically can buy own securities (can_buy_own\u202f=\u202f1) but may not sell own securities (can_sell_own\u202f=\u202f0).",
